# XNU patch series for Unisoc UMS512 / SharkL5Pro.
#
# Mirrors hxzbaka/UniXNU-t610yp (patches/ums512/*.patch), which is the reference
# first-boot tree for this SoC family:
#   ios-sweet-0001/0002/0005/0011 - build fixes for the current clang + the
#                                   physmap alignment the non-PPL kernel needs
#   ums512-open-machine-layer    - non-Apple machine layer (no AMCC/KPC/PPL)
#   ums512-uart                  - polled SPRD UART console (0x70100000), which
#                                   is what makes XNU print at all on this board
ios-sweet-0001-new-clang-drop-removed-auto-var-init-flag.patch
ios-sweet-0002-new-clang-backport-UIO_STACKBUF.patch
ios-sweet-0005-non-pac-build-fixes.patch
ios-sweet-0011-physmap-alignment.patch
ums512-open-machine-layer.patch
ums512-uart.patch